---
import { publishedPosts, postUrl } from '../lib/blog';
const posts=(await publishedPosts()).slice(0,3);
---
<section class="section guides-preview"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">BILLING · KHATA · VYAPAAR KA HISAAB</p><h2>Answers for the questions shopkeepers actually ask.</h2><p class="preview-intro">Dukaan ka hisaab kaise rakhe? Customer se kitna udhaar lena hai? Galle ka cash sales se alag kyon hai? Start with an example you can follow.</p><div class="preview-grid">{posts.map(p=><article><span>{p.data.category}</span><h3><a href={postUrl(p.id)}>{p.data.title}</a></h3><p>{p.data.description}</p></article>)}</div><a class="all-guides" href="/blog/">Explore all shopkeeper guides →</a></div></section>
<style>.guides-preview{background:var(--ag-surface-low)}.eyebrow{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ag-primary)}h2{font:800 clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem)/1.3 var(--ag-font-heading);max-width:38rem;margin:1rem 0}.preview-intro{max-width:48rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ag-text-secondary)}.preview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.2rem;margin:2rem 0}.preview-grid article{border:1px solid var(--ag-divider);border-radius:20px;padding:1.4rem;background:var(--ag-surface-lowest)}.preview-grid span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--ag-primary)}.preview-grid h3{font:800 1.15rem/1.5 var(--ag-font-heading);margin:1rem 0}.preview-grid p{line-height:1.8;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ag-text-secondary)}.all-guides{color:var(--ag-primary);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.preview-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
